From 86d7a79859ff9d4a9af4002ffbbb14f6e3c4f1d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luis Atala <luis.atala@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:25:48 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] HID: razer-barracuda: serialize explicit headset
 power-off

Expose a write-only headset_poweroff attribute. A write of 1 checks a
confirmed link and existing diagnostic transport, sends the validated MMI
command once and restores the local route under the battery query mutex.
An acknowledgment timeout after sending is not a failure or link evidence.
Power-on remains a physical action. Signal interruption still restores
the route before the write returns.

Assisted-by: LLM [OpenAI Codex]
